    "Presentation renderer, not an Altium export, netlist extractor, ERC or connectivity verification.",
    "All wire, pin and component shape coordinates are read directly from the supplied ASCII exports; no missing links or junctions are inferred.",
    "Fonts use Arial fallback and 0.7 times source line-height; pin text offsets are standardized. Text is therefore not pixel-identical to Altium.",
    "Port outlines are normalized; net names and source port positions are retained. Do not infer signal direction from these port outlines.",
    "Visible text is painted above geometry for readability. Hidden fields and non-current multipart symbol primitives are omitted according to source metadata.",
    "For readability, redundant net-label text is suppressed only when its name matches a port and its coordinate exactly matches one of that port's endpoints; the named port remains visible. Counts are reported.",
    "Full-sheet views use the custom sheet extents. One original P1 TODO text frame lies outside those extents and is clipped, not silently removed from the source.",
    "SVG data-source-line attributes link drawn primitives back to the original file line numbers."
